WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.443 --> 00:00:04.432
Unit twenty-two. Recording My Voice!

2
00:00:05.355 --> 00:00:10.296
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.346 --> 00:00:14.250
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:18.381
Today we learn about Recording My Voice. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.203 --> 00:00:22.903
Record. Say it with me. Record!

6
00:00:26.339 --> 00:00:30.072
Voice. Say it with me. Voice!

7
00:00:33.617 --> 00:00:37.750
Microphone. Say it with me. Microphone!

8
00:00:41.225 --> 00:00:44.789
Play. Say it with me. Play!

9
00:00:48.307 --> 00:00:52.307
Speak. Say it with me. Speak!

10
00:00:55.768 --> 00:00:59.517
Clear. Say it with me. Clear!

11
00:01:03.078 --> 00:01:06.804
Loud. Say it with me. Loud!

12
00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:14.360
Save. Say it with me. Save!

13
00:01:17.864 --> 00:01:27.372
I can record my voice with a microphone on a tablet. I speak clearly, not too loud or too soft. Then I play it back and save it.

14
00:01:27.422 --> 00:01:31.176
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:32.169 --> 00:01:37.544
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:37.594 --> 00:01:38.846
Microphone!

17
00:01:39.991 --> 00:01:45.627
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:45.677 --> 00:01:46.827
Loud!

19
00:01:47.829 --> 00:01:56.303
Did you know? The first sound recording machine was invented in the 1800s, long before computers!

20
00:01:56.353 --> 00:01:59.170
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:59.912 --> 00:02:08.379
Think and answer. What would you like to record your voice saying?

22
00:02:08.429 --> 00:02:09.579
Great answer!

23
00:02:10.487 --> 00:02:16.614
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:16.664 --> 00:02:19.788
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

